\## Vision



OGS Smart Money AI is an institutional-grade trading platform designed to analyze financial markets using objective Smart Money Concepts (SMC) and ICT principles.



The platform emphasizes transparency, deterministic rule-based analysis, modular architecture, and explainable trading decisions.



\---



\## Core Principles



\- No repainting

\- Rule-based logic

\- Explainable signals

\- Modular architecture

\- Professional documentation

\- Institutional software standards



